        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 11:23PM MDT until September 24 at 11:30PM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>High water flows continue within the Rio Bonito and Rio Hondo. This
Flash Flood Warning has been replaced by a Flood Warning. Please see
that bulletin for more details. Please note, additional rainfall may
cause these rivers to rise once again overnight.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT Friday for portions
of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico.
</description>
